Z||000000||bikeboy||02-08-2001||05:55 PM||||Is that your Fiero with the NorthStar in the rear? <BR>I have been looking to try and fit one in the back of a spare MR2 I have. I found a motor. I think the transaxle was hurt when the car was wrecked (looks as if a train hit it!)<BR>The Fiero Engine bay is much bigger than the Mark 1 MR2. But I I cut out the rear trunk I believe it will fit. But the width of the transaxle / Engine I think will cause me problems. The Mark I MR2 is much narrower than the Fiero. So I suspect that I may have issues with the install in that area. <P>My Question is, do you have the actual dimminsions of the engine / transaxle combo?<P>No flames here guys...I really need this info... <P>Thanks.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bill Strong<BR>1986 Toyota MR2 Super Krylon Blue||||reg||1
